#: ../../user/schema.md:3
msgid ""
"Layer 3 typed IPC for `@rescript-tauri/core`. Declare a Tauri command "
"from a single [rescript-schema](https://github.com/DZakh/rescript-schema)"
" schema pair instead of writing the encoder and decoder by hand."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/schema.md:9
msgid ""
"The Phase 2 implementation is feature-complete in `main`. The first npm "
"publish (`schema-v0.1.0`) is scheduled alongside the other Phase 2 "
"packages. Until then, consume `@rescript-tauri/schema` via the source "
"repository or a workspace link."
msgstr ""

